		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Skeleton garbed in a black cloak, wielding a scythe. Rumored to work for the Death Gods.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 76, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 scythe +10 (2d4 + death strike), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Strike</strong>. On a critical hit, CON 18+ or die.</p><p></p><p><strong>Misfortune</strong>. Mortals within near, CHA 18+ or cursed with bad luck, rolling checks and attacks with DISADV for 1d4 rounds. Beings with luck tokens are unaffected by misfortune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Supreme Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
